_id":"/docs/explanation/pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/pipeline#validation-inside-the-loop","content":"Most extractions converge within two attempts. This happens **inside** the strategy, not as a post-processing step."},"812":{"id":"/docs/explanation/pipeline-15","page_id":"/docs/explanation/pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/pipeline#validation-inside-the-loop","content":"Default: `maxAttempts` = 3."},"813":{"id":"/docs/explanation/pipeline-16","page_id":"/docs/explanation/pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/pipeline#validation-inside-the-loop","content":"See Validation & Retries for the validation concept."},"814":{"id":"/docs/explanation/pipeline-17","page_id":"/docs/explanation/pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/pipeline#the-result","content":"<TypeTable\n  type=\"{\n  data: {\n    description: 'Validated output matching your schema. If error is set, may not be trustworthy.',\n    type: 'T',\n    required: true,\n  },\n  usage: {\n    description: 'Aggregated token counts across all LLM calls',\n    type: 'Usage',\n    required: true,\n  },\n  error: {\n    description: 'Set if extraction encountered a non-fatal error',\n    type: 'Error | undefined',\n    required: false,\n  },\n}\"\n/>"},"815":{"id":"/docs/explanation/pipeline-18","page_id":"/docs/explanation/pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/pipeline#see-also","content":"Document Parsing — how files are converted to artifacts"},"816":{"id":"/docs/explanation/pipeline-19","page_id":"/docs/explanation/pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/pipeline#see-also","content":"Artifacts — the input format"},"817":{"id":"/docs/explanation/pipeline-20","page_id":"/docs/explanation/pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/pipeline#see-also","content":"Strategies — orchestration patterns"},"818":{"id":"/docs/explanation/pipeline-21","page_id":"/docs/explanation/p