escription=\"Must support tool calling\" />"},"918":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-97","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#how-it-works","content":"**Document loaded** into virtual filesystem (`/artifacts/artifact.json`, `/artifacts/manifest.json`, `/artifacts/images/`)"},"919":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-98","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#how-it-works","content":"**Agent explores** using tools: read files, grep for patterns, list directories, execute commands"},"920":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-99","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#how-it-works","content":"**Incremental extraction** — calls `set_output_data` when first data found, `update_output_data` as more discovered"},"921":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-100","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#how-it-works","content":"**Validation** — schema validation on every output update, with automatic retry on errors"},"922":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-101","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#how-it-works","content":"**Completion** — agent calls `finish` when done, or `fail` if extraction impossible"},"923":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-102","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#how-it-works","content":"The agent adapts to your document:"},"924":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-103","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#how-it-works","content":"**Small documents** — reads everything at once"},"925":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-104","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#how-it-works","content":"**Large documents** — navigates systematically, searching for relevant sections"},"926":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-105","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#how-it-works","content":"**Complex schemas** — builds output incrementally, validating as it goes"},"927":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-106","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#configuration","content":"<TypeTable\n  type=\"{\n  provider: {\n    description: 'Provider name (e.g., anthropic, openai)',\n    type: 'string',\n    required: true,\n  },\n  modelId: {\n    description: 'Model identifier (e.g., claude-sonnet-4, gpt-4o)',\n    type: 'string',\n    required: true,\n  },\n  maxSteps: {\n    description: 'Maximum agent steps/turns',\n    type: 'number',\n    default: '50',\n    required: false,\n  },\n  apiKey: {\n    description: 'API key (or use env vars)',\n    type: 'string',\n    required: false,\n  },\n  outputInstructions: {\n    description: 'Additional extraction guidance',\n    type: 'string',\n    required: false,\n  },\n  systemPrompt: {\n    description: 'Override default system prompt',\n    type: 'string',\n    required: false,\n  },\n  prefill: {\n    description:\n      'Pre-load document context as synthetic read/view_image tool calls before the first step. `textTokens` caps the text, `maxImages` (default 1) and `maxImageBytes` (default 12 MB) cap images.',\n    type: '{ textTokens: number; maxImages?: number; maxImageBytes?: number }',\n    required: false,\n  },\n}\"\n/>"},"928":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-107","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#context-prefill","content":"The agent normally spends its first steps reading `/artifact.json` and looking at the image overview. Prefill hands it that context up front so it can extract immediately:"},"929":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-108","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#context-prefill","content":"The block is deterministic — stable tool-call ids, no timestamps — so the same document always produces the same prefix and providers can prompt-cache it. Images get far less budget than text because a single page image is 1–4 MB of base64; the defaults load the image overview only."},"930":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-109","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#when-to-use","content":"**Always try agent first** — it's the default for a reason"},"931":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-110","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#when-to-use","content":"Works well for most document types and sizes"},"932":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-111","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#when-to-use","content":"Automatically adapts to document structure"},"933":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-112","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#when-to-use","content":"Best for complex schemas with nested objects"},"934":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-113","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#model-compatibility-march-2026","content":"The agent requires models that support tool/function calling:"},"935":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-114","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#model-compatibility-march-2026","content":"Provider"},"936":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-115","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#model-compatibility-march-2026","content"